  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p.mb-3 Browse the department hierarchy and open a department to manage its MAAP links, seats, and structure.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  %p.mb-3
    Departments organize titles, assignments, abilities, teams, and seats. Health and Insights roll those up by department.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %ul.mb-0
